From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Leventov <leventov.ru@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 11 Jul 2026 14:03:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 02/26] snapshot-import: repair failed imports from checkpoints

Add dry-run and execute paths that finalize a failed replace-all ZIP import from complete hidden-table checkpoints. Validate import state, component namespaces, physical mappings, hidden tablet identity and row counts, active-table drift, duplicate mappings, and the complete active-table set before activation.

Commit activation, audit logging, and the Failed-to-Completed transition atomically while preserving normal row-count semantics. Document the destructive recovery contract and verification limits in patches/snapshot_import_checkpoint_repair/README.md.
